# The docs-api image contains exactly two directories: `service/` (the
# zero-dependency Node server) and `content/` (the markdown bundle). Everything
# else in this repository belongs to the Astro marketing site, which ships to
# GitHub Pages via `deploy-pages.yaml` and is a different artifact entirely.
#
# Without this file the build context is ~150 MB (node_modules) for an image
# that COPYs ~1.3 MB. The Dockerfile's own header invites `docker build .`, so
# the cost lands on anyone following it.
node_modules
dist
.git
.github
src
astro.config.mjs
package.json
package-lock.json
*.md
